 "description": "<p>A complete catgirl costume in polyester, sold as one coordinated set, one size for 40-60 kg. Split construction keeps the top and bottom separate for adjustability.</p>\n<p>As a full-set listing, every piece arrives matched - the usual failure point of catgirl costumes is the improvised accessories, and this removes the improvisation. The playful register suits the theme; dramatic this is not.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Item type: complete set</li>\n<li>Style: catgirl</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Out of the bag and on - the complete-set promise in the catgirl category.</p>\n",
